{"id":974,"date":"2025-05-12T12:31:57","date_gmt":"2025-05-12T10:31:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/who-we-are\/"},"modified":"2026-07-25T21:34:36","modified_gmt":"2026-07-25T19:34:36","slug":"quienes-somos","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/quienes-somos\/","title":{"rendered":"Who We Are"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"974\" class=\"elementor elementor-974 elementor-32\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64366953 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"64366953\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a6c84b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7a6c84b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d227d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6d227d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1152\" height=\"2048\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/4BB8DBE1-A49D-409A-A057-3BD82A45ACFA.webp?fit=1152%2C2048&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-2048x2048 size-2048x2048 wp-image-960\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5fdd72d1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5fdd72d1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17d7ad6c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"17d7ad6c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Experience Menorca with Me, Don't just Visit it.<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-385a7e88 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"385a7e88\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">An Accredited Official Guide at your Service<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55d1a3ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"55d1a3ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>I&#8217;m Daniel Vaquera, and my purpose goes beyond showing you a beautiful place. I want you to feel the true essence of this island, to take a piece of Menorca with you in your heart. <\/p><p>As your <b>Accredited Official Guide<\/b>, my passion is to share with you the secrets that don&#8217;t appear on the maps: I&#8217;ll take you to those hidden coves with turquoise waters that we locals keep to ourselves, we&#8217;ll stroll through towns where history comes to life in every stone, and together we&#8217;ll seek out the most magical sunsets from the cliffs of the north to the port of Ciutadella.<\/p><p>Each experience is designed for you to immerse yourself in the authentic Menorca. Are you coming? <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba5895e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ba5895e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-acede20 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"acede20\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b5d9de elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8b5d9de\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Experience Menorca in a Unique Way<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ee4e0d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4ee4e0d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">My Commitment: to You and to Menorca<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c6b3f40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c6b3f40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>I have been dedicating myself to tourism for <b>more than a decade<\/b>, but my connection with Menorca comes from a lifetime. This deep love for my land is the engine of everything I do. On my routes, I don&#8217;t just share historical data; I weave for you the legends that I was told as a child and give you those personal recommendations that make the difference between a visit and an experience.  <\/p><p>My love for Menorca goes hand in hand with my commitment to protect it. That&#8217;s why I firmly believe in <g id=\"gid_0\">sustainable tourism<\/g>. Each experience I design is respectful of our incredible environment and seeks to support local artisans and producers.  <\/p><p>Because for me, traveling is not just seeing, it&#8217;s <b>connecting<\/b>. It is learning, enjoying the present moment, and taking home much more than a photo: an unforgettable memory. I invite you to discover the island under this gaze.  <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78228fe e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"78228fe\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elemento